# Lane request: M14 (ide)

## Blocking: merge of wip/render into feat/engine does not compile

`crates/mpp-eval/src/lower.rs` line 171 matches `NodeKind` exhaustively. wip/render
added `NodeKind::Placeholder { .. }` to mpp-syntax, so the match fails (E0004).
Needed one-line change, owned by the engine lane / integrator:

    K::Error | K::Placeholder { .. } => Err(fail(span, EvalError::Silent)),

The ide lane does not own mpp-eval, so it has not made this edit. Once it is on
feat/engine (or applied by the integrator), merge it into wip/ide and the ide lane
continues.

## Dependencies the ide crate adds (Cargo.lock is integrator-only)

eframe 0.37, egui 0.37, lyon_tessellation 1, rfd 0.18; dev: egui_kittest 0.37.
